# Albyana ERP — muhit o'zgaruvchilari namunasi
# Bu faylni nusxalang:  cp .env.example .env
# .env fayli hech qachon repozitoriyaga qo'shilmaydi.

# --- Umumiy ---
APP_NAME="Albyana"
APP_TIMEZONE="Asia/Tashkent"
APP_CURRENCY="UZS"
APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# --- Ma'lumotlar bazasi (serverli versiya uchun) ---
# Namuna: postgresql://foydalanuvchi:parol@host:5432/albyana
DATABASE_URL=""

# --- Autentifikatsiya (serverli versiya uchun) ---
# Tasodifiy uzun satr yarating:  openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET=""
SESSION_MAX_AGE_DAYS="7"

# --- Birinchi direktor hisobi (faqat dastlabki o'rnatish uchun) ---
# O'rnatishdan keyin bu qatorlarni bo'shating.
SEED_DIRECTOR_LOGIN=""
SEED_DIRECTOR_PASSWORD=""

# --- Zaxira ---
BACKUP_DIR="./zaxira"
